Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.38,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(349.711,268.301)\fade(255,0,255,0,860,3860,4700)}Episode 33
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.38,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(349,414.659)\fade(255,0,255,0,860,3860,4700)}Gathering of Heroes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:37.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(121.089,370.317)}Zhōu Yú \NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:44.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(583.692,352.247)}Lǔ Sù \NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked Xuande into coming, \Nso why didn't you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yunchang is among the world's bravest generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He and Xuande are never apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I made any attempt, he would easily slay me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:00:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The present enemy of Eastern Wu is Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If our alliance fell apart, \Nit would damage our cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Liu Bei and Kongming are not eliminated, \Nthey will become a danger to Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.10,0:01:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal, Cao Cao has sent an envoy with a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.79,0:01:43.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(352,473.678)}"Marshal Zhou, surrender!" \N- Great Chancellor of the Hàn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag him out and behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:01:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal, when nations are at war, envoys shouldn't be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.98,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, do you imply I cannot kill a traitor's envoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out and display his head for all to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,His blood will be our tribute! \NTomorrow, we march!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.55,0:02:14.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal, spare my life! Spare my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Eastern Wu's vanguard, Gan Ning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares challenge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:38.24,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(570.044,373.8)}Gān Níng \NStyled: Xīngbà
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:45.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(575.878,344.749)}Cài Mào \NStyled: Déguī
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:04:02.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(569.067,355.011)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eastern Wu's forces are weak, yet you were defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All for your incompetence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Jing Province's navy has not been drilled recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Qing and Xu soldiers are not suited for naval warfare, hence our defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We must establish a naval training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those from Qing, Xu, and Jing Provinces will be trained rigorously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.65,0:04:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Each day they will gain experience. They will be battle-ready soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the Marshal of the Navy! \NCan't you act like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why even bother me with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.57,0:04:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously-!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing and Xingba, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, Xingba, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.93,0:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.57,0:05:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal, the Cao navy is inexperienced,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so they have set up a naval training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the camp's lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Xingba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.18,0:05:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare a colored ship without any insignia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring drums and arm the men with powerful crossbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me to scout the enemy's naval camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We two could gauge their strength on our own. Why must you, the Grand Marshal, go personally?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.23,0:06:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes a colored ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! It's so vibrant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What type of boat is it? A merchant ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be a spy ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Inform the Chancellor at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:07:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's not a spy ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor barely tolerates us Jing provincials to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The boats along the river are well-organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.27,0:07:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Their navy is improving rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are the commanders of their naval force?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao and Zhang Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:08:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They have led the navy for a long time, \Nand are skilled in naval warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we get rid of those two first, defeating Cao Cao will be easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.31,0:08:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfurl the sails! Back to camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.87,0:08:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That Zhou the Youth spied on our naval camp! When we went after them, they withdrew!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:09:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That insolent Zhou the Youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, he won a battle, \Nfrustrating our troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he has also spied on our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What strategy can be used to counter him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, your subject, Jiang Gan, is willing to go to Jiangdong
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:31.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.356,359.955)}Jiǎng Gàn \NStyled: Zǐyì
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and persuade Zhou the Youth to submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi, are you and Zhou Gongjin friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.91,0:09:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was young, we were fellow students and intimate friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I use my powers of persuasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain I can convince Zhou the Youth \Nto lay down arms and surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi, what will you need when you cross the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one page and two servants, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Bring wine for Ziyi to take along.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:13.33,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.33,0:10:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, a man who claims to be your \Nold friend, Jiang Gan, wishes to visit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A guest is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, I hope you've been well since we last met.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.19,0:11:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, you crossed stormy waves and strong winds without hesitation to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you've come to speak on behalf of the Cao clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been apart for so long, I have truly missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I came to reminisce about the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you suspect me of coming as an envoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that you do not welcome old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One need not be a musical master like Shi Kuang of old,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:43.98,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Shi Kuang (师旷) was a famous music master and early humanist from the Jin state who specialized in the Qin-zither, during the Spring and Autumn period.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to hear a sweet song and understand the meaning behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you treat old friends like this, I had better just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you aren't here on his behalf, why leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:11:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, your eloquence is famous throughout the realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so I worried you had come to persuade me to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all, not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you aren't here on his behalf, \NI'll treat you as an old friend again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Spread the order!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All officers are to gather in the main tent! \NI shall hold a banquet to welcome Ziyi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Jiang is my old classmate and a good friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Though he came from the north, \Nhe is not here as Cao Cao's envoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you all not to be suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Taishi Ci!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Present!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:13:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I award you the sword of command \Nduring this feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's banquet is a gathering for old friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for camaraderie, so no talk of politics!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who speaks of military affairs will be executed without pardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(586.667,221.511)}Tàishǐ Cí \NStyled: Zǐyì
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, I haven't had a drop of wine since I took command.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But with old friends gathered today, I may drink without worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.37,0:14:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, let's have a toast together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, come follow me outside the tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As you desire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, I remember that when we were just classmates,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,your eloquence was often praised by our teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that when you debated the scholars of Jianghuai, none could best you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, you flatter me too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity, what a pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it a pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.67,0:15:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, look at the men of my tent, aren't they powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, you are a leader of bears and tigers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, look at my navy, aren't they mighty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mighty indeed, and unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at my provisions, aren't they plentiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You indeed have elite troops and abundant supplies! Your reputation is well-deserved!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, when we were classmates, \Ndid you ever imagine we'd meet like this today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, with your talent this is neither unexpected nor unearned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}When a great man finds a worthy lord to serve,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}he grows to know his lord intimately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911}Outwardly minister and lord are professional, \Nbut inwardly they are close as kinsmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}He listens and follows the minister's plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}sharing disaster or fortune, glory or disgrace,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}with the same mind and virtue, working together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}That... is how Zhou Yu does things!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.08}Even if the famously eloquent Su Qin and Zhang Yi returned from the dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:09.58,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Sū Qín and Zhāng Yí were rival political strategists and diplomats of the Warring States period.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911}their words a rushing torrent, \Ntheir tongues as sharp as steel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.21,0:17:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}my heart would yet be unswayed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.99,0:17:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This lot of great generals are all heroes of Jiangdong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This meeting can be called a meeting of heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A meeting of heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,More wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, though we drink, we need entertainment!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I perform a sword dance and sing us a merry song?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Good idea, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:26.48,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}A true man walks on this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:30.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}to make his name the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:35.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}And when he's done his best,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:39.37,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}in peace he can make his rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:43.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}When a man has made his rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:47.16,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}he will quaff fine wine with zest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:51.92,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}When a man's drunk as drunk can be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:59.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}He sings a madman's litany!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:09.27,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}A true man walks on this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.27,0:20:12.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}to make his name the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:15.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}And when he's done his best,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:18.45,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}in peace he can make his rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:21.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}When a man has made his rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:24.27,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}he will quaff fine wine with zest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.27,0:20:27.55,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}When a man's drunk as drunk can be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:30.75,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}He sings a madman's litany!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:33.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}When a man has made his rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.67,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}he will quaff fine wine with zest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:39.67,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}When a man's drunk as drunk can be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:49.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}He sings a madman's litany!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,have you really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really not here to convince me to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, we were classmates and dear friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.91,0:21:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.51,0:21:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I can't see through your plot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you implying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to get me to surrender to the Cao clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.02,0:21:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I couldn't see it!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:21:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, you have gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly came to meet with my old friend again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.92,0:22:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to forget our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.76,0:22:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cannot believe me- then I shall put my life in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,do with me as you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.31,0:22:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I must've lost my temper after drinking, I hope you can forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.18,0:22:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! Have three more rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.45,0:22:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.00,0:23:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I already had too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.86,0:23:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.47,0:23:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, we have been apart for many years!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.58,0:23:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we sleep together on the same bed like when we were classmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, you're busy with military affairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.46,0:23:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I should not overstay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.51,0:23:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're like brothers! What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.92,0:24:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Today was the meeting of heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.09,0:24:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We've enjoyed it together, \Nso let us now retire together!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.22,0:24:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.75,0:24:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell! Farewell! Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.20,0:25:58.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(352,437.089)}"Message to the Marquis of Wu."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.66,0:26:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}Cao Cao is like a ravenous tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.12,0:26:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}Though he is the Chancellor of Han, he is a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.47,0:26:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911}General, you have divine strength, and possess your family's ferocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.51,0:26:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\}You control Jiangdong, \Nyour domain stretches 1,000{\i1} li,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.28,0:26:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911}with elite troops, ample supplies, and heroic commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.98,0:26:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}This is the time for conquest!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.69,0:26:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911\pos(352,502.355)}It is time to cleanse the Han Dynasty of such evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.26,0:26:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.911}This is our chance to replace these rotten foundations!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:10.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(352,469.722)}"From Cai Mao and Zhang Yun."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.24,0:27:28.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,To the Grand Marshal of Eastern Wu, Gongjin:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.30,0:27:30.75,Thinking,,0,0,0,,We surrendered not for wealth, \Nbut due to their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.75,0:27:33.24,Thinking,,0,0,0,,We claim to train the soldiers, \Nso as to keep them in camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.24,0:27:36.08,Thinking,,0,0,0,,When we get the chance, we'll present Cao Cao's head to you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.08,0:27:39.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,We will be in contact. \NHave faith in us, this is our humble reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.14,0:27:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao and Zhang Yun pay our respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.90,0:27:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.57,0:28:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.12,0:28:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, are you calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.92,0:28:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few days, I'll have you see that traitor's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.57,0:28:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, whose head will you show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.92,0:28:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The traitor Cao Cao's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.80,0:28:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will you take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.17,0:28:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.98,0:29:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal, are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.75,0:29:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal, are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.87,0:29:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is in my bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.15,0:29:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,At the feast, sir, you got drunk and asked Jiang Gan to sleep with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.77,0:29:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.32,0:29:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't normally get so drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.04,0:29:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, I may have made some mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.97,0:29:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have been talking in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.14,0:29:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Marshal, someone from the north has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.52,0:30:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.73,0:30:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.72,0:30:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What is so pressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.77,0:30:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Marshals Cai and Zhang are still facing some difficulties in their task-
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.92,0:31:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.17,0:31:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately Ziyi is in a drunken slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.81,0:32:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin is a very careful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.47,0:32:44.32,Thinking,,0,0,0,,If he finds a letter is missing in the morning, won't I be in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.69,0:32:48.04,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Ah, I must leave at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.92,0:33:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.98,0:33:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you, Master Jiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.57,0:33:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.64,0:33:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that I am bothering the Grand Marshal, so I will take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.53,0:33:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go on, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.67,0:33:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell! Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.27,0:33:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.57,0:33:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.05,0:33:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail! Set sail now!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.04,0:33:44.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(579.822,371.822)}Zhūgé Liàng \NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.35,0:34:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor has invited you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.43,0:34:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.29,0:34:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.47,0:34:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu was generous and noble, \Nmoreover he was clever and careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.26,0:34:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,None of my words could sway him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.47,0:34:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan was a failure, \Nand we end up looking like fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.16,0:34:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, although I wasn't able to persuade Zhou Yu,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.67,0:34:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I did find some important information for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.02,0:35:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.57,0:35:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Those despicable traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.07,0:35:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you should decide upon this quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wait, there may be problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.78,0:35:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.53,0:35:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.09,0:35:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your orders, Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.47,0:35:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Cai Mao and Zhang Yun!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.07,0:35:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.90,0:35:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.53,0:36:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao and Zhang Yun!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.85,0:36:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.72,0:36:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to march to Sanjiangkou \Nat once and attack Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.85,0:37:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, our naval forces aren't ready yet! Please don't be hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.32,0:37:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I would sit idly by,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.62,0:37:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,while you two train my own Navy to bring my head to Zhou Yu?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.77,0:37:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.37,0:37:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.17,0:37:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Behead them!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.02,0:37:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.71,0:37:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! We are innocent, we swear! Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.77,0:37:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Bring them back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.47,0:38:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, you bastard...!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.27,0:38:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.92,0:38:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao and Zhang Yun were surrendered generals, and thus served half-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.76,0:38:25.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(513.333,374.789)}Xún Yōu \NStyled: Gōngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.56,0:38:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Their deaths today may prevent future problems. So it is ultimately favorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.92,0:38:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why did you execute Cai Mao and Zhang Yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.00,0:38:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two led surrendered Jing Province troops, but were careless and neglected military law,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.67,0:38:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so I had them put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.01,0:38:55.21,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(110.489,377.755)}Xú Shù \NStyled: Yuánzhí
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.57,0:39:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we are still training the navy, \Nso we should appoint new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mao Jie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.00,0:39:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.47,0:39:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu Jin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.95,0:39:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.53,0:39:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you two to replace them as Marshals of the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.99,0:39:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.27,0:39:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!

